{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "03d88f9b0c01a8ba761f63eceaaf0d36416b1722e6d87a94cbbdfb8030dfd987", "ja": "テキスト無し", "zh": "无文本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "ad11948da1777e4f79ddfbb2bba72844210e91737956de8cf5bb14ba4dead974", "ja": "……ミズキ。翼から連絡は？", "zh": "……瑞希。翼有联系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "59977d5923efd9356a07d6c227c2a0642b15bf3b249b4ce8f3a251544aa20843", "ja": "いえ、今のところありません。\n留守電を残したので、聞いてもらえるといいのですが。", "zh": "还没有，目前没有收到。\n我已经留了语音留言，希望她能听一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "69795cde6d49059f41f3f7fc130710af8734137acb693986c866e243d9d187a5", "ja": "なるほど。\nまぁ、そうかなとは思った。", "zh": "原来如此。\n嗯，我也觉得大概是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1005_406gsp", "source_sha256": "3d8b9921e02cbfda927e584711f21bb26a2e4e3d0169bda52a64a6022aa22f06", "ja": "お待たせ！　みんな集まって……って、あれ？\nまだふたりだけか？", "zh": "让大家久等了！大家都到齐了……咦？\n怎么还只有两个人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "348b23138f808a425203231fbb97e2f1851b3f1f6654e69dd0eceaf2ec99287e", "ja": "はい。伊吹さんはまだです。\nもしかしたら、お忙しいのかもしれません。", "zh": "是的，伊吹小姐还没到。\n说不定是因为有事在忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "17752133958ef37718e5c37bf3297daa4b0ce484e341ad10bc184f5c3978cec9", "ja": "途中の店で何か見つけた……とか、\nそんなところじゃないか？", "zh": "说不定是在路上的店里发现了什么……大概是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1008_406gsp", "source_sha256": "de55033b1d09e6e44e922e80cbdb3e84cc6eac87b6708d33cc779933a7b9d952", "ja": "な、なるほど……。じゃあ悪いけど、\n翼には後でふたりから伝えてもらおうかな。", "zh": "那、原来如此……那么不好意思，之后能麻烦你们两个转告翼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1009_406gsp", "source_sha256": "b65a1b67fc20a866f3858998fd3f916055e6a20421521108ad12024bc7ccc3c3", "ja": "じつは、3人にライブの出演依頼がきたんだ。\n『新宿バンドフェス』っていうイベントなんだが……。", "zh": "其实，有个叫“新宿乐队节”的活动，邀请3人参加现场演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "da7ece52fcb200dcd867784c5793fdd44ca99fe156b6d12e9a2919c2a76de1c0", "ja": "って、それ音楽雑誌が主催しているヤツだろ！？\nウチらに声をかけるなんて、見る目あるじゃないか！", "zh": "那可是音乐杂志主办的活动吧！？居然会邀请我们，真有眼光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "d344c0cebc6dccb5e11722920fe5cc633c8e57abcebc2faf6667c42217f4b61a", "ja": "徹夜明けの勢いで乗り切った、先日のステージを\n見てくれたのでしょうか。腕が鳴ります……バキバキ。", "zh": "或许是看到了前几天我们通宵之后，\n顺着那股劲头全力完成的舞台吧。跃跃欲试……咯吱咯吱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1012_406gsp", "source_sha256": "7f077463c5d9f7cd6a6d8255e14700fc15c2850f6362e5593bee41043a3944e8", "ja": "ふたりが乗り気でよかったよ。じゃあ、よろしく頼む。\n翼も相変わらずみたいだけど、サポートよろしくな！", "zh": "你们两个愿意积极参与真是太好了。那就拜托了。\n翼也还是老样子，支援工作就交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633", "ja": "30分後……", "zh": "30分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dbe6f11999cf8c61de9701f9da581814bfd10e6c17dedf2e272f22b742939b05", "ja": "おはよーございまーす♪\n……あれ？　プロデューサーさんは？", "zh": "早上好♪……咦？制作人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "ab59da41d225e73ff6ffa96ce43b88a22f9b50026daecd8259440f7392753235", "ja": "おはようございます、伊吹さん。\nプロデューサーは次の打ち合わせに出かけました。", "zh": "早上好，伊吹小姐。\n制作人去参加下一场会议了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "287254dbdc01c7b318058e235228a3f8040df6f3e5740dc1895dc6f142c23863", "ja": "え～！　すっごく可愛い服を見つけたの、\nガマンしてこっち来たのに～！", "zh": "诶～！我都发现超级可爱的衣服了，还忍住没买就赶过来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "d5c01fb3f0c21f6597138abe02404ef6601a4ae67d04130152674d1096a79c2d", "ja": "いや、そもそも服を見つけてる場合じゃないだろ？\n遅刻だぞ、ち・こ・く！", "zh": "不是，根本就不是看衣服的时候吧？\n你迟到了，迟·到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "87ecc65d8a9768cde2ab3bdbc787e650fc216602ad1a7e7ae17e37a16dbb44a2", "ja": "うう～。\n瑞希ちゃん、ジュリアーノ怒ってる～？", "zh": "呜呜～。\n瑞希，茱莉亚是不是生气了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "d50adf109eb3dc2b0b5ce9ef48227bbcc4c11d4ccaf77983405eaeaf6485b792", "ja": "大丈夫です。ジュリアさんは、おそらく怒っていますが\nただ怒っているのではありません……そう、愛のムチ。", "zh": "没事的。茱莉亚虽然恐怕是在生气，\n但不仅是单纯在生气……是的，这是爱的鞭策。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "28145a45fc88f1aafd5892ffcfe51b92d36d5b833fa32afb7a972fc000a65f5d", "ja": "ややこしい言い方をするな。プロデューサーに面倒みろ\nって頼まれたんだよ。…説明するから、ちゃんと聞け。", "zh": "别把话说得那么复杂。是制作人拜托我\n照顾你们的。……我要开始说明了，好好听着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3169421a4ac99a13d8b16c6e0ae48cc464134a1a89a72705cab2640c4aa1ae5c", "ja": "なんかわかんないけど……は～い♪", "zh": "虽然不太明白是怎么回事……好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a4d49480ebc7b7929dde1b6a3c2f0054ed732da1c83422ce2a96fd2f4cc7eba", "ja": "わあ～！\nライブハウスで歌うとか、なんか楽しそ～♪", "zh": "哇～！\n在LiveHouse唱歌什么的，感觉好开心哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "ddce5b98588c462d1fce27e69c11f2d767e58f55700bd6e8d214840ef2fa1581", "ja": "楽しい、が……それだけじゃない。アイドルにとっちゃ\nたぶん完全アウェーだ。気ぃ引き締めないとな。", "zh": "开心是开心，但……不只是这样。对偶像来说，\n这里大概完全是客场。得打起精神来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d0a7a43cd0b76d2119329543c87bd43afa29da71050a8c6991aa08df758e20b3", "ja": "わかってまーす。つまり～……。\nわたしは、思いっきり歌えばいいんだよね？", "zh": "知道啦——也就是说～……\n我只要尽情放声歌唱，就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "7b89a5a73db042f72786347c8b1e9583791baa101eb5c26eaf98d0ac9efa7087", "ja": "……まぁ。そういうことだ。", "zh": "……嗯。就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0a73c862c0fbfb0d387cc01d01d15ce9f5f1843e856efe479e8247cf1d1f82dd", "ja": "それじゃ、瑞希ちゃん、ジュリアーノ。\nお疲れ様でした～♪", "zh": "那就，瑞希，茱莉亚啦。辛苦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "ddbd44c8eb3eb707d7d0956e23901f37d7ad7e5b867c04296598449a6e730d95", "ja": "……伊吹さん、少し変わりましたね。", "zh": "……伊吹同学，变得有点不一样了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "11b03bee182c7eddf28d1e8b0faf8c523f43892135a24357441687cadbf7f021", "ja": "初っ端から遅刻してきたけどな。\nあー、まだ翼に振り回される毎日が続くのか……。", "zh": "一上来就迟到了，不过。\n啊——看来每天被翼折腾得团团转的日子还要继续下去啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "12497955864e8bccf632502a775a1ff2a69e43bb1d01cd29f16ae8dff3c687e7", "ja": "……はい。\n楽しみですね、ジュリアさん。", "zh": "……是的。\n真令人期待呢，茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "5492cf86a7eb312741fd119bb665e6e78516c7135bef0ed850ee4a0f58097477", "ja": "……一緒にすんなっての。", "zh": "……别把我和你混为一谈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0343_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_intro_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "e91a427bca2e3de1934090e2fec77efb218abd2efece8c3706a9f7dc234be4df", "ja": "（どうして私達が、伊吹さんとともにステージに\n出ることになったのか。そう、きっかけは……）", "zh": "（我们为什么会和伊吹小姐一起登上舞台。没错，起因是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
